{"asset_key":"mn3/herohub_story_10414010","episode":"mn3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10414010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1041401001:1":{"text":"Hmm, is there a bit of dirt on my face?","source_cn":"唔唔，我脸上的毛毛是不是有点脏了呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB3D519450BE82A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041401002:1":{"text":"Hammie, are you seriously using Lucius' shield as a mirror?!","source_cn":"漫漫，你怎么能把卢修斯的盾牌当镜子照！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80047EFFDF0303FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1041401002":{"text":"Hammie, are you seriously using Lucius' shield as a mirror?!","source_cn":"漫漫，你怎么能把卢修斯的盾牌当镜子照！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80047EFFDF0303FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041401003:1":{"text":"Of course! That's what you get when I carefully polish it every single day.","source_cn":"啊哈哈，确实受过祝福没错，但要说珍贵什么的就有点夸张了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05C0C9DBEC3990D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041401005:1":{"text":"This shield gets no use during downtime, it might as well serve another purpose.","source_cn":"闲暇之时，能让漫漫小姐欣赏自己的容颜，这面盾牌想必也会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x284215CDEA3074C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041401006:1":{"text":"So I don't mind, Hammie. Feel free to use my shield whenever you wish.\nBy the way, there's no dirt on your face.","source_cn":"不用客气，漫漫，随便照吧。\\n捎带一提，你脸上的毛很干净哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4794E4DB8BB39714","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041401007:1":{"text":"Wow, Lucius is such a cool guy.\nIn comparison, these other two...","source_cn":"哇，卢修斯先生真的好有风度……\\n相比之下，另外一位…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ECAEC8C688773EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1041401007":{"text":"Wow, Lucius is such a cool guy.\nIn comparison, these other two...","source_cn":"哇，卢修斯先生真的好有风度……\\n相比之下，另外一位……不，两位自称骑士的家伙就完全……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ECAEC8C688773EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041401008:1":{"text":"Hey! Chippy is the best Acorn Knight out there!","source_cn":"什、什么！满满是真正的橡果骑士！不是自封！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x405C624F7EB46B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041401010:1":{"text":"I didn't realize Lucius was such a sweet-talker.","source_cn":"之前没觉得卢修斯是这种会花言巧语的类型。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD674AD925E87D4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041401011:1":{"text":"Our sweet little Hammie has the biggest blush on her face right now!","source_cn":"我们的使魔小姐都被你几句话说得晕头转向了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x475D5BB05FF51F7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041401012:1":{"text":"Hm? I was just speaking the truth.\nDoing what you can for others is something we ought to do, right?","source_cn":"嗯？我只是实话实说而已。\\n有余力的前提下，尽量为他人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD85676B800DC2F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041401013:1":{"text":"With me serving the Temple and you serving the Knight's Order.","source_cn":"而且，为圣堂服务的我和为骑士团效力的你，也需要以身作则...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE214E5050717464D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041401014:1":{"text":"Jeez, such sincerity only adds to your charm!","source_cn":"这种诚恳的态度，反而更能增添魅力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34923117E398C3F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"She means you, Chippy.","source_cn":"说你呢，满满","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x78148D68CC075567","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"She means you, Chippy.","female":"She means you, Chippy.","variant_male_record_index":"63142","variant_female_record_index":"63143","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041401009:1":{"text":"Aha, Hammie, you really love your jokes... I am a proper knight, you know!","source_cn":"我可不是自称，是正正经经的骑士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x900065F0D517BF9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"Got anything to say, Valen?","source_cn":"有什么想说的吗，维伦","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2775876762180BFE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Got anything to say, Valen?","female":"Got anything to say, Valen?","variant_male_record_index":"63144","variant_female_record_index":"63145","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"It is quite shiny.","source_cn":"那可是珍贵的武器","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x711E8309FC19F9AC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It is quite shiny.","female":"It is quite shiny.","variant_male_record_index":"63138","variant_female_record_index":"63139","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041401004:1":{"text":"Um... Magister... what do you think a shield is used for?","source_cn":"的确，我每天都有擦拭和保养，看起来效果还不错嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDAE2AB5D5DE9520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"What else would you do with it?","source_cn":"毕竟擦得很亮嘛……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C755705A8D71125","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What else would you do with it?","female":"What else would you do with it?","variant_male_record_index":"63140","variant_female_record_index":"63141","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"Lucius","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"Valen","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":4}}